{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261111%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1030　32庭　聆案官黃健棠<br/>宏福苑五級火　總承建商宏業被債權人入稟呈請清盤｜公司清盤呈請</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　37庭　暫委判官勞潔儀<br/>西醫蔡淑梅涉濫發「免針紙」｜裁決<br/>► 1000　7庭　法官練錦鴻<br/>中學男教師被控3年前校內非禮女生｜裁決<br/>► 0930　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>廉署火網行動搗圍標案｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>涉中大校園內醉駕撞車後不顧而去　前立法會議員黃錦輝被控4罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>女子涉旺角街頭遺棄幼犬被控｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸屯門法院<br/>► 1030　7庭　裁判官覃有方<br/>元朗水蕉新村套丁案｜續審</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:01:46.910845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:34:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:33.884202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:54:57.401159+00:00","content_hash":"e7d28c68d4b978ddb4b178f2ae769cab5716752d1a3f8e5a43630d8cd706b46b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_